# Without the source-supersession drop (#4885), replaying an older ordinary
# write after a newer batch resubmits its operation id with another payload.
MODULE: NoIdentityConflictReplaysSuperseded
TARGET: NoIdentityConflict
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a replayed ordinary write the source already superseded is resubmitted under its old id
PERTURBS: Flip

--- FIND
          /\ IF Superseded(e) \/ old = new
--- REPLACE
          /\ IF old = new
--- END
